DD2D DD1E             (    forth6809.asm):02060                  FDB   H_ABORT
DD2F DDC8             (    forth6809.asm):02061                  FDB   QUIT
                      (    forth6809.asm):02062         
                      (    forth6809.asm):02063         ; FIND had no dictionary entry at all - confirmed by checking for
