DD48 32               (    forth6809.asm):02085                  FCC   "2"
DD49 DD40             (    forth6809.asm):02086                  FDB   H_M1
DD4B FEB9             (    forth6809.asm):02087                  FDB   TWOBODY
                      (    forth6809.asm):02088         
DD4D 02               (    forth6809.asm):02089         H_M2:    FCB   2
