                      (    forth6809.asm):02656                                   ; semantics call for it - just not on every
                      (    forth6809.asm):02657                                   ; single line of an otherwise-uninterrupted
                      (    forth6809.asm):02658                                   ; session. Confirmed via MAME debugger.
                      (    forth6809.asm):02659         
DDD1 BDE5A1           (    forth6809.asm):02660         QLOOP:   JSR   QUERY
                      (    forth6809.asm):02661         
