                      (    forth6809.asm):07845                                      ; by direct comparison. FM/MOD, by
                      (    forth6809.asm):07846                                      ; contrast, has an explicit flooring
                      (    forth6809.asm):07847                                      ; adjustment step (correcting the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07848                                      ; quotient and remainder when the
